<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stocks plunge 3.28 pct before close.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stocks plunge 3.28 pct before close.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan share prices plunged 3.28 percent just minutes before the close on Friday as selling of industrial shares intensified, brokers said.</p>
<p>With 10 minutes of trade remaining, at 0350 GMT, the index had lost 278.07 points or 3.28 percent to 8,207.59. Turnover was T$109 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
